            "heading": "Who we are.",
            "text": "<p>Coach has always stood for the freedom to express yourself with confidence. Crafted with care, our bags, accessories, and shoes are designed to last. We're proud to support creativity and self-expression in communities around the world.</p>",
            "layout": "text",
            "frame": "standard",
